                        질문을 입력하셨나요? 검색을 눌러보세요!
                    </div>
                )}
            </div> */}
            {/* 🎯 [하단 Snap] 상세 질문 입력 스냅바 (Intent Snap Bar - Light Version) */}
            {/* <div className="fixed bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-4xl px-6 z-50">
                <div className="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-2xl p-3 pl-8 pr-3 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] border border-slate-200/60 flex items-center gap-6 group transition-all hover:bg-white hover:border-slate-300">
                    <div className="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0">
